  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>DM Lab Experiment 1: Healthcare Data Warehouse ETL Pipeline
1. CSV Input: patient_visits.csv
2. Select Values: Data typing &amp; bounds
3. Value Mapper: Standardize codes
4. Dimension Lookup: Resolve Patient, Doctor, Hospital &amp; Date FKs
5. Table Output: Load into Fact_Patient_Visit</note>
      <xloc>100</xloc>
      <yloc>40</yloc>
      <width>420</width>
      <heigth>100</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>9</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
